{"id":"ics-071","stemHtml":"<p>64 位 x86-64 下，函数</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">long sh(long x, int n) { return x &lt;&lt; n; }</code></pre></p>\n<p>编译成</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-text\">sh:\n    movq    %rdi, %rax\n    movl    %esi, %ecx\n    salq    %cl, %rax\n    ret</code></pre></p>\n<p>(1) 求 <code>sh(1, 64)</code>、<code>sh(1, 65)</code>、<code>sh(1, 63)</code>、<code>sh(1, -1)</code> 的实际返回值，并解释 <code>n = 64</code> 为什么得到 1。</p>\n<p>(2) 如果函数参数类型是 <code>int</code>（即做 32 位移位，指令为 <code>sall %cl, %eax</code>），那么 <code>n = 31</code>、<code>n = 32</code>、<code>n = 64</code> 分别得到什么？为什么掩码位数会变？</p>\n<p>(3) C 标准对移位量 <code>n</code> 有什么要求？为什么 <code>sh(1, 64)</code> 在 C 里是未定义行为，而汇编却&quot;有确定结果&quot;？</p>\n<p>(4) 编译器在 <code>-O2</code> 下可能怎样利用&quot;未定义行为&quot;？举一个&quot;常量折叠结果与硬件结果不同&quot;的例子（不必写出具体数值，说明为什么不可依赖即可）。</p>\n<p>(5) 如果确实想利用 x86 硬件的&quot;按位取模&quot;语义写跨平台安全的代码，应该怎么写？</p>\n","hintHtml":"<code>%cl</code> 只有 8 位，x86 的移位指令会再按<strong>操作数宽度</strong>取模：64 位操作数用 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\bmod 64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span>，32 位操作数用 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\bmod 32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span>。C 标准与此无关：它规定移位量必须小于类型宽度且非负，越界就是未定义行为。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p><strong>(1)</strong> x86 的 64 位移位只使用 <code>%cl</code> 的低 <strong>6 位</strong>作为移位量，即实际移位 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\bmod 64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li<code>sh(1, 64)</code>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>64</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64\\bmod64=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>，左移 0 位，得 <strong>1</strong>；</li>\n<li<code>sh(1, 65)</code>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>65</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>64</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">65\\bmod64=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>，得 <strong>2</strong>；</li>\n<li<code>sh(1, 63)</code>：左移 63 位，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>63</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{63}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">63</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的位模式是 <code>0x8000000000000000</code>，作为有符号数是 <strong><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>63</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2^{63}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">63</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>；</li>\n<li<code>sh(1, -1)</code>：<code>%cl</code> 是 <code>0xFF</code>，取低 6 位得 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>63</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">63</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">63</span></span></span></span>，所以同样是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>63</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{63}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">63</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的位模式，得 <strong><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>63</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2^{63}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">63</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>为什么想到</strong>：<code>salq %cl, %rax</code> 的移位量来自寄存器，硬件不会检查范围，只用 <code>%cl</code> 的低 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>64</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 64=6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span> 位；<code>movl %esi, %ecx</code> 只是把 32 位参数放到 <code>%ecx</code>，真正起作用的是 <code>%cl</code> 的 8 位里的低 6 位。</p>\n<p><strong>(2)</strong> 32 位操作数只用 <code>%cl</code> 的低 <strong>5 位</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li<code>n = 31</code>：左移 31 位，<code>0x80000000</code>，作为 <code>int</code> 是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>31</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2^{31}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">31</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li<code>n = 32</code>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32\\bmod32=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>，得 <strong>1</strong>；</li>\n<li<code>n = 64</code>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64\\bmod32=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>，得 <strong>1</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>为什么掩码位数会变</strong>：移位是&quot;在操作数的位宽内移动&quot;，32 位寄存器只有 32 个位置，超过 31 的移位量硬件取模 32；64 位取模 64。所以同一段 C 源码，<code>int</code> 版和 <code>long</code> 版在 <code>n = 32</code> 处表现完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>(3)</strong> C 标准规定：左移/右移的移位量必须<strong>非负</strong>且<strong>小于类型宽度</strong>，否则是未定义行为。<code>sh(1, 64)</code> 在 C 层面越界，编译器可以假设它不会发生；而汇编指令对移位量取模是硬件定义的行为，两者不是一回事——&quot;汇编有确定结果&quot;不能推出&quot;C 程序有确定结果&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>(4)</strong> 编译器可以利用&quot;<code>n</code> 一定在 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>64</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,64)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 内&quot;这一假设做优化，例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>范围分析：如果 <code>n</code> 来自 <code>[0,64)</code> 之外的比较分支，编译器可以删掉某些检查；</li>\n<li>常量折叠：<code>sh(1, 64)</code> 这种常量表达式可以直接被算成任意值（不同编译器、不同版本可能给 0、1 或警告），因为它本来就属于未定义行为；</li>\n<li>代数化简：<code>(x &lt;&lt; n) &gt;&gt; n == x</code> 之类的变换只在 <code>n</code> 合法时成立，编译器可能据此改写。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以写 C 时不能依赖 x86 的&quot;取模&quot;行为；这类代码换编译器、换优化级别就可能出错。</p>\n<p><strong>(5)</strong> 若确实想要&quot;按位取模&quot;的语义，必须<strong>显式写出来</strong>：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">long sh(long x, int n) {\n    return (long)((unsigned long)x &lt;&lt; (n &amp; 63));\n}</code></pre></p>\n<p>要点：先把 <code>x</code> 转成无符号（避免左移溢出/符号位问题），再把移位量与 63 相与，把语义固定成&quot;模 64&quot;；或者用 <code>n % 64</code>（注意 <code>n</code> 为负时 C 的 <code>%</code> 结果可能为负，要配合无符号）。更好的做法是先判断 <code>n</code> 在 <code>[0,64)</code> 内，否则按业务逻辑返回错误，而不是依赖硬件行为。</p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是以为 <code>sh(1, 64)</code> 会得到 0（&quot;移光了&quot;），忽略硬件取模。二是把 <code>%cl</code> 的 8 位当移位量，忘记还要按操作数宽度取模，导致 32 位与 64 位结果混为一谈。三是把&quot;汇编结果确定&quot;等同于&quot;C 程序结果确定&quot;，在 C 里依赖未定义行为。四是写跨平台代码时只加 <code>n &amp; 63</code> 却忘了先把 <code>x</code> 转成无符号，左移溢出仍是问题。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>sh(1,64)=1、sh(1,65)=2、sh(1,63) 与 sh(1,-1) 都等于 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>63</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2^{63}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">63</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；硬件把移位量按操作数宽度取模（64 位取低 6 位、32 位取低 5 位）；C 标准规定越界移位是未定义行为，编译器可以假设 n 在 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>64</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,64)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 内做优化</p>\n"}